{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "postgres_exporter 기반 DB 서버 지표. HikariCP 대시보드는 애플리케이션(클라이언트) 쪽 커넥션 풀만 보여주고, 이 대시보드는 Postgres 서버 내부(캐시 히트율, 테이블별 seq scan/index scan, 트랜잭션)를 본다.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "none", "min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [
          { "color": "red", "value": null },
          { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.9 },
          { "color": "green", "value": 0.99 }
        ] } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{datname=\"coming\"}[5m])) / (sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit{datname=\"coming\"}[5m])) + sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_read{datname=\"coming\"}[5m])))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "버퍼 캐시 히트율",
      "type": "gauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pg_stat_database_numbackends{datname=\"coming\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "활성 커넥션 (numbackends)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pg_up",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "pg_up",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit{datname=\"coming\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "commit",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback{datname=\"coming\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "rollback",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "트랜잭션 속도",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (relname) (rate(pg_stat_user_tables_seq_scan{datname=\"coming\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{relname}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "테이블별 Sequential Scan 속도 (인덱스 없이 풀스캔되는 쿼리 감지용)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (relname) (rate(pg_stat_user_tables_idx_scan{datname=\"coming\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{relname}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "테이블별 Index Scan 속도",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pg_stat_user_tables_n_live_tup{datname=\"coming\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{relname}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "테이블별 행 수 (n_live_tup) — 부하테스트 더미 데이터 시딩/정리 추적용",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pg_stat_user_tables_n_dead_tup{datname=\"coming\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{relname}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "테이블별 Dead Tuple 수 (대량 삭제 후 vacuum 여부 확인용)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "id": 9,
      "options": { "showHeader": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, pg_stat_statements_seconds_total) * on(queryid) group_left(query) pg_stat_statements_query_id",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "쿼리별 누적 총 실행시간 상위 10개 (DB 전체 부하 기여도가 큰 쿼리)",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": { "showHeader": true },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, pg_stat_statements_seconds_total / pg_stat_statements_calls_total) * on(queryid) group_left(query) pg_stat_statements_query_id",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "쿼리별 평균 실행시간 상위 10개 (호출 1회당 느린 쿼리 — 인덱스 후보)",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Value", "desc": false }] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (relname, indexrelname) (pg_statio_user_indexes_idx_blks_hit_total) / (sum by (relname, indexrelname) (pg_statio_user_indexes_idx_blks_hit_total) + sum by (relname, indexrelname) (pg_statio_user_indexes_idx_blks_read_total))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "인덱스별 캐시 히트율 (낮을수록 디스크 I/O 유발 — 인덱스 효율 점검용)",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": null,
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 33 },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "pg_stat_user_tables_table_size_bytes{datname=\"coming\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{relname}} (table)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "pg_stat_user_tables_index_size_bytes{datname=\"coming\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{relname}} (index)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "테이블별 테이블/인덱스 크기 (인덱스 추가 시 스토리지 비용 tradeoff 확인용)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["coming-backend", "postgres"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "PostgreSQL (postgres_exporter)",
  "uid": "coming-postgres",
  "version": 1
}
